{"2609400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreaminal", "steam_appid": 2609400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Get involved in the development and the community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/1660d51e8ea8c214dc330389ec9a7390.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreaminal</strong> is a unique horror co-op   experience based on &quot;<strong>The Backrooms</strong>&quot; creepypasta with a story for 1-4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story and all the endings to see the true intentions of <strong>D-SYNC</strong>. Have fun with the puzzles, but don't get too comfortable... <strong>It is always watching you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the real world to tell them what really happened (Is it really possible?) or be stuck in there <i>forever</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/5f5dbae8e03fc20c0fc76657f503d7e1.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing puzzles for every level, each one with its unique concept and mechanics. Hack your way through a facility computer, manipulate time to your advantage. Oh and don't forget to play with the floaties and waterslides in the poolrooms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.poster.avif?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.webm?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.mp4?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/12a36879c46c211930a7c8847a8c8811.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions throughout the game influence the ending you receive. Discover hidden levels, uncover new facets of the story, and reach different outcomes depending on how you interact with the environment and approach each puzzle. The levels themselves will shift and change based on the paths you take and the decisions you make, ensuring a unique experience each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/c43add784e964cac7c2b93224b6ea48d.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique levels and multiple sublevels with distinct aesthetics and challenges. Each level offers fresh experiences, hidden secrets, and engaging puzzles to keep gameplay exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.poster.avif?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.webm?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.mp4?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/a3d197be8562f436a5e7b06c829f009f.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Dreaminal the way you want, whether that is without entities, normal or nightmare mode where there are more entities, less items and harder to find puzzle parts.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/1660d51e8ea8c214dc330389ec9a7390.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreaminal</strong> is a unique horror co-op   experience based on &quot;<strong>The Backrooms</strong>&quot; creepypasta with a story for 1-4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story and all the endings to see the true intentions of <strong>D-SYNC</strong>. Have fun with the puzzles, but don't get too comfortable... <strong>It is always watching you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the real world to tell them what really happened (Is it really possible?) or be stuck in there <i>forever</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/5f5dbae8e03fc20c0fc76657f503d7e1.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing puzzles for every level, each one with its unique concept and mechanics. Hack your way through a facility computer, manipulate time to your advantage. Oh and don't forget to play with the floaties and waterslides in the poolrooms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.poster.avif?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.webm?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/dad8f252690d82988d77dc1b422864f0.mp4?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/12a36879c46c211930a7c8847a8c8811.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions throughout the game influence the ending you receive. Discover hidden levels, uncover new facets of the story, and reach different outcomes depending on how you interact with the environment and approach each puzzle. The levels themselves will shift and change based on the paths you take and the decisions you make, ensuring a unique experience each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/c43add784e964cac7c2b93224b6ea48d.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique levels and multiple sublevels with distinct aesthetics and challenges. Each level offers fresh experiences, hidden secrets, and engaging puzzles to keep gameplay exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.poster.avif?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.webm?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/094374d97b291b2c4d24af9e9aa41052.mp4?t=1784910916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/extras/a3d197be8562f436a5e7b06c829f009f.webp?t=1784910916\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Dreaminal the way you want, whether that is without entities, normal or nightmare mode where there are more entities, less items and harder to find puzzle parts.</p>", "short_description": "DREAMINAL is a deeply immersive horror experience for 1-4 players. Sent from a megacorp to be the &quot;pioneer&quot; of solving a global problem, but you quickly discover things aren't as they promised. Survive and find your way out of the Backrooms... if escape is even possible.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/10e8765a762f16dbfc24ba2a2eeb56bd42bc52ee/header.jpg?t=1784910916", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/84f552608d2cd5ff6aa4b1c94fac31fd530eed27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784910916", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609400/84f552608d2cd5ff6aa4b1c94fac31fd530eed27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17849